<Bindings>
    <!-- Per-button keybinds for our own action bars, so they show up (and are
         nameable) in Escape -> Key Bindings under their own tab.
         category="BINDING_HEADER_DRIEVACTIONBARS" is what puts them in their own
         left-hand category (a binding with no category lands under "Other"); the
         tab/section title is the value of that global, set in ActionBars.lua. This
         mirrors how Blizzard tabs its own bindings (e.g. category='BINDING_HEADER_MOVEMENT').
         Button names are absolute action slots (DrievABarButtonN = slot N), but they
         are listed here grouped by BAR (Bar 1 first, then Bar 2, ...) so the Key
         Bindings list shows the bars in 1..10 order. Which slots a bar owns is set
         by BAR_PAGE in ActionBars.lua; keep this order in sync with it.
         ":Keybind" matches the buttons keyBoundClickButton (ActionBars.lua), which
         keeps the left mouse button free for dragging abilities off a slot.
         Bars that mirror a Blizzard bar can also be bound from Blizzards own Action
         Bar tabs - see BLIZZ_BINDING in ActionBars.lua. -->
    <!-- Action Bar 1 (page 1) -->
    <Binding name="CLICK DrievABarButton1:Keybind" category="BINDING_HEADER_DRIEVACTIONBARS" header="DRIEVACTIONBARS"/>
    <Binding name="CLICK DrievABarButton2:Keybind" category="BINDING_HEADER_DRIEVACTIONBARS"/>
